Value LOCAL_PORT (\S+)
Value CHASSIS_ID ([0-9A-Fa-f:]{17})
Value PORT_ID (\S+)
Value MGMT_ADDRESS (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value HOST_NAME (\S+)
Value CAPABILITY (.*?)

Start
  # Rows are space-delimited with optional trailing columns. Anchor on the
  # local port + chassis id; everything after is best-effort optional.
  ^${LOCAL_PORT}\s+${CHASSIS_ID}(\s+${PORT_ID})?(\s+${MGMT_ADDRESS})?(\s+${HOST_NAME})?(\s+${CAPABILITY})?\s*$$ -> Record
  ^LocalPort\s+ChassisId
  ^-+\s+-+
  ^LLDP\s+Remote
  ^System\s+Capability
  ^\s*$$
  ^\.\s*$$
